{
  "info": {
    "name": "home-rental-service",
    "_postman_id": "e4ec778f-08fb-414f-adc2-0541756a4ad8",
    "description": "Home Rental Service API - All Endpoints\n\n## Authentication\n- Register: `POST /auth/register` → Verify OTP: `POST /auth/verify-otp` → Complete: `POST /auth/complete-registration`\n- Login: `POST /auth/login` (sets `accessToken` / `ownerToken` / `adminToken` / `inspectorToken`)\n\n## Owner Workflow\n1. **Register & Login** as owner (sets `ownerToken` and `accessToken`)\n2. **Get Locations**: Fetch governorates and areas for property location\n3. **Get Terms**: Review active rental terms and commission percentages\n4. **Create Application**: Submit property with details, amenities, and photos\n5. **Submit Inspection Windows**: Provide 4-5 time slots for inspection (after admin assigns inspector)\n6. **Get Schedules**: View proposed and confirmed inspection times\n7. **Submit Consent**: Agree to rental terms and provide consent\n\n## Admin Workflow\n1. **Admin Login**: `POST /auth/login` with `{\"usernameOrPhone\": \"+201000000001\", \"password\": \"Admin@123456\"}` (sets `adminToken`)\n2. **List Applications**: Review all submitted applications\n3. **Review Application**: Approve (→ UNDER_REVIEW) or Reject (→ REJECTED)\n4. **Assign Inspector**: Assign an inspector to an application (→ PENDING_INSPECTOR_SLOTS)\n5. **Review Report**: Approve report (→ PENDING_OWNER_CONSENT), Reject (→ REJECTED), or Request Re-inspection\n6. **Activate Listing**: Activate once owner has consented (→ LISTED)\n\n## Inspector Workflow\n1. **Inspector Login**: `POST /auth/login` with `{\"usernameOrPhone\": \"+201000000002\", \"password\": \"Inspector@123456\"}` (sets `inspectorToken`)\n2. **List Assigned Applications**: View all applications assigned to you\n3. **Get Schedules**: View proposed inspection windows for an application\n4. **Confirm Slot**: Pick exact inspection time within a proposed window (→ INSPECTION_SCHEDULED)\n5. **Submit Report**: Submit inspection findings and property details (→ INSPECTION_COMPLETED)\n\n## Collection Variables\n- `baseUrl`: API base URL (default: http://localhost:8080)\n- `accessToken`: Set after any login\n- `ownerToken`: Set after owner login\n- `adminToken`: Set after admin login\n- `inspectorToken`: Set after inspector login\n- `registrationToken`: Set after verify-otp (used in complete-registration)\n- `applicationId`: Current application ID for testing\n- `scheduleId`: Current inspection schedule ID\n",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
